WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Nina Patel: I'm proposing we lean harder into data freshness as the primary positioning pillar this year.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Rachel Kim: How confident are we that resonates in competitive deals specifically?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Nina Patel: Win-loss data supports it, it's cited often when we win against Northstar.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Marcus Lee: If we shift positioning, the objection handling guide and battlecards both need updates.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Nina Patel: I'll coordinate those updates once the brief is finalized.
